content_section_1_="
After installing the browser extension, it automatically detects media resources when you visit webpages containing video or audio.<br/>It supports nearly all common video formats and streaming protocols, including MP4, MKV, M3U8, and MPD, as well as downloads from most live streams. Both the browser extension and the desktop client must be installed to download live streams.
"

content_section_3_="
它提供了2種從網頁上下載影片和音訊的簡單方法。
"

content_section_4_="
1: 影片旁邊的浮動欄中下載。
"

content_section_5_="
2: 從小圖示快顯視窗中下載。
"

 
